==Persecution==
Scildists are one of the most persecuted religious groups on Basis, particularly outside of [[Meran]] where they are a minority. U/C

==Criticism==
Criticism of Scildism goes back to the beginnings of the religion in [[Byrak]] and [[Ottelia]], where it was initially seen as an insult to the gods. U/C

